          "en": "if this scrolls into view now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.77,
          "end": 69.15,
          "en": "But if I click on it, then it actually is replaced",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.15,
